    "description": "Rules for acquiring and improving skills and features through independent study, instructors, and training aids.",
    "body": "# Learning & Study Mechanics\n\nCharacters can acquire new skills and features through dedicated study periods between adventures.\n\n## Study Periods\n- **Improving Existing Skill**: **1 day per current rank** to attempt gaining the next rank point.\n- **Learning New Skill**: **1d4+1 days** to attempt gaining Rank 1.\n- **Learning New Feature**: **1 week** (with instructor) or **2+ weeks** (self-taught).\n\n## Study Check Resolution\nAt the conclusion of the study period, make an **Easy (CR 10) Intellect check**:\n- **Self-Taught**: Success grants **0.5 Skill Points** per period (1 point per 2 periods).\n- **Learning from an Instructor (Trained 6+)**: Grants **+1 to the check per instructor skill tier** and yields **1.0 Skill Point** on success.\n- **Study Aids**: High-quality manuals/holo-courses grant **+1 to +5** bonus to the check."
