    "modifiers": [],
    "body": "# Comprehensive Damage Types Directory\n\n**Category**: Core Combat Rules & Tables\n\nTangent features a rich ecosystem of damage types, categorized into Kinetic, Energy, and Variative/Elemental profiles:\n\n---\n\n## 1. Kinetic Damage Types\n- **Blunt (Crushing)**: Heavy impact trauma against armor plates and skeletal structures.\n- **Slashing (Cutting)**: Edged lacerations causing deep wounds and the **Bleeding** status effect.\n- **Piercing (Puncturing)**: Focused needle/bullet penetration targeting weak points and internal organs.\n- **Force**: Kinetic subtype consisting of concentrated kinetic fields that **ignores 1/2 of Target Armor DR**.\n- **Concussive / Impact**: Whole-body traumatic energy from crashes, falls, and explosions. Split equally between Vitality and Health; ignores or halves DR.\n- **Bleed Damage**: Persistent status effect (1d4 damage/turn, ignores DR) inflicted by slashing/piercing crits.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Energy Damage Types\n- **Pyro / Fire**: Intense heat setting targets ablaze with the **Burning** status effect (1d6/round + panic).\n- **Cryo / Cold**: Endothermic freeze draining speed and inflicting the **Freeze** condition (Speed 0, vulnerable).\n- **Spectral / Phase**: Incorporeal energy that **ignores physical Armor DR entirely** to disrupt life essence.\n- **Sonic / Sound**: Harmonic acoustic resonance that **ignores most physical armor** and deafens foes.\n- **Voltic / Electrical**: Electrostatic arcs stunning targets and overloading cyberware, robotics, and power conduits.\n- **Corrosive / Disintegration**: Acidic chemical dissolution permanently degrading armor DR and melting flesh.\n- **Ra-D / Radiation**: Ionizing gamma rays inducing radiation sickness, cell necrosis, and mutations.\n- **Force Pulse / Disruption**: Destabilizes molecular bonds, crumbling targets and disintegrating matter.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Variative & Elemental Damage Types\n- **Air Elemental**: Concussive atmospheric gales knocking foes **Prone** and disrupting flight.\n- **Fire Elemental**: Primal volcanic flame scorching terrain and applying Burning.\n- **Earth Elemental**: Massive lithic crushing weight and seismic tremors.\n- **Water Elemental**: High-pressure hydraulic torrents causing concussive trauma and drowning.\n- **Radiant / Light**: Pure solar light blinding evil/undead entities with the **Blinded** condition.\n- **Umbral / Shadow**: Primal void darkness leeching vitality and inflicting Exhaustion.\n- **Celestial**: Sacred transcendent power smiting fiends and undead with radiant fury.\n- **Infernal**: Corrupting hellfire and Stygian damnation eroding mind and soul.\n- **Dimensional**: Spacetime tearing and spatial shearing that completely bypasses Armor DR.\n- **Psyche / Mental**: Direct psionic and neural trauma **ignoring physical armor entirely**; resisted by Willpower."
