    "body": "# Limb Damage: Destroyed Threshold (2/3 Health)\n\n**Category**: Core Combat Rules & Tables\n\n## Mechanics\n- **Threshold**: Taking **2/3rds of Health Score** in damage to an area damages it **beyond ANY further use** (Brain Death** if Head).\n- **No Check**: There is **NO saving throw or Stamina check**; the limb is mangled and useless.\n- **Traumatic Shock**: Traumatic Damage Control is immediately required for shock, blood loss, and vital collapse.\n- **Brain Death Discretion**: Brain death is at the GM's discretion (as any instant kill). If the character survives, they remain permanently disabled without intense recovery, surgery, and downtime."
