    "body": "# Limb Damage: Disabled Threshold (1/3 Health)\n\n**Category**: Core Combat Rules & Tables\n\n## Mechanics\n- **Threshold**: Taking **1/3rd of Health Score** in damage to a limb disables it (or causes Unconsciousness if dealt to the Head).\n- **Stamina Check**: The character must pass a **Stamina Check with CR = 10 + Damage Taken** to keep using the limb.\n- **Debilitating Penalties**:\n  - **Head**: **-4 on all actions**.\n  - **Arm**: **-4 Strength and Agility** for actions using that arm.\n  - **Leg**: **Half Ground Speed** and **no Rush Maneuver**.\n- **Healing**: Medical attention or Metaphysics is required to properly restore function."
