    "body": "# Movement & Action: Iterative Attacks & Terrain\n\n**Category**: Core Combat Rules & Tables\n\n## Mechanics\n- **Iterative Attacks**: If a combatant moves more than a 5-foot step during their turn, they are restricted to **1 Attack Action** regardless of higher skill rank unlocks.\n- **Difficult Terrain**: Movement speed is reduced to **x1/2**. Imposes a **-2 penalty to attacks** while in motion due to jarring footing (**-4 penalty** if movement is reduced to 1/4)."
