    "modifiers": [],
    "description": "Applying secondary auxiliary skills to grant flat +2 or +4 synergy bonuses to primary skill tasks.",
    "body": "# Skill Synergy System\n\nSkill Synergy rewards characters for applying multidisciplinary knowledge to a task.\n\n## The Flat Bonus Model\nWhen an auxiliary skill has a clear, logical connection to the primary check:\n- **Trained Secondary (Rank 5 to 9)**: Grants a flat **+2 Synergy Bonus** to the primary check.\n- **Expert Secondary (Rank 10+)**: Grants a flat **+4 Synergy Bonus** to the primary check.\n\n### Example\nA character attempting a Reason (Intellect) check to decipher an ancient inscription who possesses 6 ranks in **Language** adds a flat **+2 synergy bonus** to their check."
