    "modifiers": [],
    "description": "Mechanical adjustments for taking additional time or forcing rapid execution of skill checks.",
    "body": "# Time Modifiers: Meticulous vs. Rushed\n\nThe time dedicated to a task directly modifies the check result:\n\n## Meticulous Checks (Taking Extra Time)\nTaking extra time allows careful measurement and double-checking:\n- **+50% Time**: **+2 Bonus**\n- **+100% Time**: **+4 Bonus**\n- **+150% Time**: **+6 Bonus**\n- **+200% Time**: **+8 Bonus** (Maximum)\n\n*Note: Experts and Masters gain increased bonuses per time stage (+3 and +4 per stage).*\n\n## Rushed Checks (Hasty Execution)\nForcing rapid completion increases mistake probability:\n- **3/4 Base Time (-25%)**: **-2 Penalty**\n- **1/2 Base Time (-50%)**: **-4 Penalty**\n- **1/4 Base Time (-75%)**: **-8 Penalty**\n\n## Untrained Penalties\nWhen an Untrained character (Rank 0) rushes or takes extra time, the modifiers are shifted **1 step worse**."
